{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mantian-e-o059a","title":"吴将孙布遣人诣扬州求降乞兵迎","accounts":[{"id":"mantian-a-826a4d072df4be5cf679","label":"正文","text":"吴将孙布遣人诣扬州求降乞兵迎","evidence":["mantian-q-c77ea86335cf8d58295c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0066","role":"遣人诣扬州求降、辞云道远不能自致乞兵见迎","evidence":["mantian-q-c77ea86335cf8d58295c"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0004","role":"刺史，腾布书、请兵马迎之","evidence":["mantian-q-c77ea86335cf8d58295c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["mantian-q-c77ea86335cf8d58295c"]},"ordering_evidence":"mantian-q-c77ea86335cf8d58295c","source_order":[26,51,0],"order":5150},{"id":"mantian-e-o060b","title":"宠以为诈不与兵凌单遣督将往迎败","accounts":[{"id":"mantian-a-7ae6208ade06457f2329","label":"正文","text":"宠以为诈不与兵凌单遣督将往迎败","evidence":["mantian-q-e5162d418f649149ef71"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0038","role":"以为必诈不与兵、敕留府长史勿与兵","evidence":["mantian-q-e5162d418f649149ef71"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0004","role":"索兵不得、单遣督将步骑七百往迎","evidence":["mantian-q-e5162d418f649149ef71"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0066","role":"夜掩击魏督将","evidence":["mantian-q-e5162d418f649149ef71"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["mantian-q-e5162d418f649149ef71"]},"ordering_evidence":"mantian-q-e5162d418f649149ef71","source_order":[26,51,55],"order":5151},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o098b","title":"孙布诈降诱王凌王凌迎之","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o098b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙布诈降诱王凌王凌迎之","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o098b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0066","role":"诈降","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o098b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0004","role":"迎军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o098b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":231,"label":"夏","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y231","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o097","basis":"夏"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o098b-q","wuzhu-q-o097","zhuge-q-o038","zhuge-q-b-d3a3709d8bfa728137f8"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o098b-q","source_order":[47,506,"O098b"],"order":8299}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0066","name":"孙布","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o098","mantian-q-c77ea86335cf8d58295c","mantian-q-e5162d418f649149ef71"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o098-wuzhu-p0066","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o098"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mantian-q-c77ea86335cf8d58295c","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-65896e231fb5799a30b0","layer":"original","quote":"其明年，吴将孙布遣人诣扬州求降，辞云：“道远不能自致〖13〗，乞兵见迎。”刺史王凌腾布书〖14〗，请兵马迎之","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"mantian-q-e5162d418f649149ef71","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-65896e231fb5799a30b0","layer":"original","quote":"宠以为必诈，不与兵；而为凌作报书曰：“知识邪正〖15〗，欲避祸就顺，去暴归道；甚相嘉尚！今欲遣兵相迎，然计兵少则不足相卫，多则事必远闻；且先密计以成本志，临时节度其宜。”宠会被书当入朝，敕留府长史：“若凌欲往迎，勿与兵也！”凌于后索兵不得，乃单遣一督将步骑七百人往迎之。布夜掩击，督将迸走〖16〗，死伤过半","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":208},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o098b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-0f75467a4877665885dc","layer":"original","quote":"中郎将孙布诈降，以诱魏将王凌〖12〗；凌以军迎布。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":505,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":54},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o097","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-933251543c833a99d654","layer":"original","quote":"三年春二月〖9〗，遣太常潘濬率众五万讨武陵蛮夷〖10〗。卫温、诸葛直，皆以违诏无功，下狱诛。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":504,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o098","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-0f75467a4877665885dc","layer":"original","quote":"夏，有野蚕成茧，大如卵。由拳野稻自生〖11〗，改为禾兴县。中郎将孙布诈降，以诱魏将王凌〖12〗；凌以军迎布。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":505,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-d3a3709d8bfa728137f8","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-d3a3709d8bfa728137f8","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗九年：建兴九年（公元 231）。张郃中箭身亡之处名叫木门，在今天水西南约 60 余公里的牡丹乡木门村，位于祁山以东不远。木门道所经过的峡谷，深邃陡峭，最窄处宽度仅 50 米左右。附近曾有当时的箭镞、刀、矛、弓等文物出土。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7893325ea43d52084752","start":0,"end":113},{"id":"zhuge-q-o038","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-975c90b64c3e4282352a","layer":"original","quote":"九年〖1〗，亮复出祁山，以木牛运，﹝一﹞粮尽退军；与魏将张郃交战，射杀郃。﹝二﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":257,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
